n begin="00:17.770" end="00:20.050">numb</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.080" end="00:24.490"><span begin="00:20.080" end="00:20.320">Don't </span><span begin="00:20.320" end="00:20.770">shut </span><span begin="00:20.770" end="00:21.130">your </span><span begin="00:21.130" end="00:21.850">eyes </span><span begin="00:21.850" end="00:22.000">till </span><span begin="00:22.000" end="00:22.150">we </span><span begin="00:22.150" end="00:22.600">fade </span><span begin="00:22.600" end="00:22.750">to </span><span begin="00:22.750" end="00:24.460">black</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.490" end="00:31.600"><span begin="00:24.490" end="00:24.790">Cause </span><span begin="00:24.790" end="00:25.630">maybe </span><span begin="00:25.630" end="00:26.050">this </span><span begin="00:26.050" end="00:26.920">time </span><span begin="00:26.920" end="00:27.010">the </span><span begin="00:27.010" end="00:27.190">good </span><span begin="00:27.190" end="00:27.670">stuff </span><span begin="00:27.670" end="00:27.850">could </span><span begin="00:27.850" end="00:29.350">last</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.600" end="00:33.970"><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:31.780">You </span><span begin="00:31.780" end="00:31.990">won </span><span begin="00:31.990" end="00:32.320">me </span><span begin="00:32.320" end="00:33.700">over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.970" end="00:41.530"><span begin="00:33.970" end="00:34.390">My </span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.810">orange </span><span begin="00:34.810" end="00:35.230">cola </span><span begin="00:35.230" end="00:35.530">got </span><span begin="00:35.530" end="00:36.160">black </span><span begin="00:36.160" end="00:38.020">flamingoes </span><span begin="00:38.020" end="00:39.280">crying </span><span begin="00:39.280" end="00:39.910">for </span><span begin="00:39.910" end="00:41.500">ya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.530" end="00:44.080"><span begin="00:41.530" end="00:41.740">Well </span><span begin