 </span><span begin="01:53.110" end="01:53.560">fade </span><span begin="01:53.560" end="01:53.740">to </span><span begin="01:53.740" end="01:54.640">black</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.390" end="02:00.310"><span begin="01:55.390" end="01:55.750">Cause </span><span begin="01:55.750" end="01:56.590">maybe </span><span begin="01:56.590" end="01:57.010">this </span><span begin="01:57.010" end="01:57.880">time </span><span begin="01:57.880" end="01:57.940">the </span><span begin="01:57.940" end="01:58.150">good </span><span begin="01:58.150" end="01:58.630">stuff </span><span begin="01:58.630" end="01:58.810">could </span><span begin="01:58.810" end="02:00.310">last</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.310" end="02:27.190"><span begin="02:00.310" end="02:00.460">Come </span><span begin="02:00.460" end="02:01.120"> </span><span begin="02:01.120" end="02:22.600">a </span><span begin="02:22.600" end="02:22.900">little </span><span begin="02:22.900" end="02:24.460">closer</span><span begin="02:24.460" end="02:24.790">, </span><span begin="02:24.790" end="02:25.180">it's </span><span begin="02:25.180" end="02:27.130">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.190" end="02:32.350"><span begin="02:27.190" end="02:27.310">I'll </span><span begin="02:27.310" end="02:27.550">be </span><span begin="02:27.550" end="02:27.880">your </span><span begin="02:27.880" end="02:28.870">character </span><span begin="02:28.870" end="02:29.440">with </span><span begin="02:29.440" end="02:30.250">flaws </span><span begin="02:30.250" end="02:31.600">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.350" end="02:37.330"><span begin="02:32.350" end="02:32.680">Come </span><span begin="02:32.680" end="02:32.740">a </span><span begin="02:32.740" end="02:33.040">little </span><span begin="02:33.040" end="02:33.940">closer</span><span begin="02:33.940" end="02:33.940">, </span><span begin="02:33.940" end="02:34.660">my </span><span begin="02:34.660" end="02:34.690"> </span><span be